 new variables into the right-hand side of the above equation. This gives\n\n$$\n{y}^{‴}=-5{x}_{3}+3{t}^{2}{x}_{2}.\n$$\n\nNotice that we do not include any derivative terms on the right-hand side. \n\nTherefore, our complete system of equations is as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}={x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}={x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{3}^{′}=3{t}^{2}{x}_{2}-5{x}_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can represent this system as the matrix differential equation ${x}^{′}(t)=Ax(t)$ as follows:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′} \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′} \\\\ {x}_{3}^{′}\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 3{t}^{2} & -5\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nHence, $a=3{t}^{2},b=1,c=-5,$ and $a+b+c=3{t}^{2}-4.$" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397916 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397917 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397916 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397918 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397916 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397919 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397916 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397920 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397916 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397921 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397916 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397916 1077 "selection" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397916 1079 #edb/ref 17592186397917 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397916 1080 #uuid "efb92f1c-9bb7-5cc3-9d68-87a83b156926" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397917 1081 "3{t}^{2}-4" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397917 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397917 1084 #uuid "c7229bfb-a300-5998-a619-1f9803777e61" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397918 1081 "3{t}^{2}+1" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397918 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397918 1084 #uuid "47f6d5bf-dad