\\\\ 0 & 2v & u\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =⟨|\\begin{aligned}0 & v \\\\ 2v & u\\end{aligned}|,\\,-|\\begin{aligned}2u & v \\\\ 0 & u\\end{aligned}|,\\,|\\begin{aligned}2u & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2v\\end{aligned}|⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-2{v}^{2},\\,-2{u}^{2},\\,4uv⟩,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖ & =‖⟨-2{v}^{2},\\,-2{u}^{2},\\,4uv⟩‖ \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-2{v}^{2})^{2}+(-2{u}^{2})^{2}+(4uv)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4{v}^{4}+4{u}^{4}+16{u}^{2}{v}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4({u}^{4}+{v}^{4}+4{u}^{2}{v}^{2})} \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{{u}^{4}+{v}^{4}+4{u}^{2}{v}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface area is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}\\,\\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}2\\sqrt{{u}^{4}+{v}^{4}+4{u}^{2}{v}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397978 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397979 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397978 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397980 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397978 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397981 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397978 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397982 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397978 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397983 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397978 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397978 1077 "selection" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397978 1079 #edb/ref 17592186397980 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397978 1080 #uuid "0b095c98-f0c4-52f0-b54c-c5176a3e6c0c" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397979 1081 "\\sqrt{{u}^{2}+{v}^{2}}" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397979 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397979 1084 #uuid "0a16278f-a652-5ce3-b9f8-9f80d8b88232" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397980 1081 "2\\sqrt{{u}^{4}+{v}^{4}+4{u}^{2}{v}^{2}}" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397980 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13