able.\n\n| $y$ | $0$ | $15$ | $16$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $0.35$ | $0.35$ | $0.3$ |\n\nTherefore, $a=15,c=0.35,$ and $a+c=15.35.$" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398053 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398054 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398053 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398055 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398053 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398056 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398053 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398057 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398053 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398058 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398053 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398053 1077 "selection" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398053 1079 #edb/ref 17592186398058 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398053 1080 #uuid "d189ffbc-6988-5f0d-b648-2094c34edecd" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398054 1081 "16.35" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398054 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398054 1084 #uuid "d0b43087-8938-50cf-8f93-076d97c2600c" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398055 1081 "15.17" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398055 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398055 1084 #uuid "668fd009-35cb-5151-a226-5758cb5844bd" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398056 1081 "15.2" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398056 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398056 1084 #uuid "1f673251-36a6-5343-9088-515f7b9c6820" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398057 1081 "15.15" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398057 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398057 1084 #uuid "1917483a-e41a-50c0-a367-ad84ba924b68" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398058 1081 "15.35" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398058